#: scenario5:scenario5_4192DE52_71D2_4CD7_A2B6_2560383B81C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e0e10ea89528b711b8c736fca6aa74f6209eaa369d21ce261e52a0642e51d44
#. default-sha256: 1c9ea25772726b83b0036b33db03f379b65104f92cb9e7bd589678cc14e9a638
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4192DE52_71D2_4CD7_A2B6_2560383B81C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I didn’t really "
"understand Michel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Je ne comprenais pas "
"vraiment Michel."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2175D33D_9FEE_4962_9030_ACDA650195EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4b1599eb6feaba846f05d5ae30c7d3a36fca0bc36192b791597c4991649dd56
#. default-sha256: 63b816d1e94aec60118146cd6a826d9b3c9ee214ba197b6ed6b51fbeb526223f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2175D33D_9FEE_4962_9030_ACDA650195EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that was probably because we were still essentially strangers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais c’était probablement dû au fait que nous étions encore des étrangers l’un pour l’autre."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B9E5076F_86BC_4FCD_8795_13236C3198BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9623131a88aac431568b6494eec8a91c9d6cb61bae39741898f4b0c5292c2143
#. default-sha256: 3d4d9ddeafcbb412d2c86397942ec4c19da899ee6357238dc785e3a243e532e5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B9E5076F_86BC_4FCD_8795_13236C3198BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having been sent to the mansion as reparation for my mistakes,⟪k:1⟫I wasn’t sure who I might "
"find there,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫On m’avait envoyée au manoir pour réparer mes fautes mais⟪k:1⟫je ne savais pas qui j’allais "
"trouver sur place ;"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A3ED3E4_ACAB_4EEC_A286_785C54D46722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7037ba23d719e2d97623484c6233a27e231a805780552e75984f6c546d4d5919
#. default-sha256: 9432846ddc48eb908cb81e0e3d3e72f78572010908e7d3a1295173ef1ef2ab73
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A3ED3E4_ACAB_4EEC_A286_785C54D46722"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but I was tentatively convinced he wasn’t a ⟪k:1⟫terrible⟪k:2⟫ person.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He didn’t do "
"anything to me—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫except stay away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫j’étais tentée de croire qu’il n’était pas ⟪k:1⟫méchant⟪k:2⟫.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Il ne me faisait rien—"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ à part m’éviter."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A399BDC_0574_4BE2_B2F0_3315DDB85EE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82c301f6cd476d8f8298eaadc4806c8c9d6849d70b897a412ce5b5305cb8c87d
#. default-sha256: d6231fd81711453876a5acb78954cf338b6318ff294e03b0777fa60c8208ea9e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A399BDC_0574_4BE2_B2F0_3315DDB85EE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Michel spent most of his time in his chambers,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Michel passait le plus clair de son temps dans ses appartements,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6AD7B8F3_2F9A_4C61_9642_13D41D84E7C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18143916aee12cb90dd63736f693eac7c4e9376f15a51b8538ca8d52cf768b1d
#. default-sha256: acb506707c932558cded6c89307ff6698b097fe64ddbbb8a918a18b5c9fab028
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6AD7B8F3_2F9A_4C61_9642_13D41D84E7C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫which he had told me to never enter under any circumstances,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫où je ne devais entrer sous aucun prétexte,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_837EFFAC_46B5_46CA_90AC_C53143E2947A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6cc426b5c59e1bb6cd29a0e5b70de80b3432239b5a68660a010c305e511b2cd
#. default-sha256: f9289e1e653e6b884ff3cb9b8478e8025fe46179567826dc9fb31f4069142ac3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_837EFFAC_46B5_46CA_90AC_C53143E2947A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so we rarely encountered one another in the halls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫donc nous avions peu d’occasions d’échanger dans les couloirs."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C61B705_A21D_410F_B346_EB157082420C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51368796f67cab3cb546cbf933719cd56a22172f8af778202a33b76cdf26da16
#. default-sha256: 3ecfc122d7b51b44483f334addbe8dd3272928e17ef9b62be59ea51b79ec8355
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5C61B705_A21D_410F_B346_EB157082420C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For that reason, I made an effort to be kind and cheerful on the sporadic occasions we ⟪k:1⟫"
"did⟪k:2⟫ cross paths."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pour cette raison, je faisais un effort pour paraître serviable et enjouée les rares fois où "
"nous nous croisions vraiment."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DD88F4CD_6D98_4C70_B736_FA324FDB6E3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf167ed8c96c31717369073d6b9599697efba0a515548861cf1b1378863bedcc
#. default-sha256: 575866952b8d0714df4fb6fc8046f3eb68094b124a11d0cee5d77b0163b59bd6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DD88F4CD_6D98_4C70_B736_FA324FDB6E3E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I figured if I kept that up long enough,⟪k:1⟫he would eventually warm up to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je me disais que si je continuais à faire bonne figure,⟪k:1⟫il finirait par se montrer plus "
"amical."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C5F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 094005697435ec510fcb57a447b7fc74e44cc4b8c470c5f6f947ebbcba2acc3b
#. default-sha256: ec87617ac960b53532f3770231cc87b4875b54189193f1147127d0861da0a71c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C5F8F9BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And as new housemates, being able to enjoy our time together was obviously preferable to the "
"alternative."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et comme nous partagions la même demeure depuis peu de temps, il me semblait préférable "
"qu’on réussisse à s’entendre plutôt que l’inverse."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C6F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a3a1927558c725e2c67d7c04992aadadec5afc86da5ef329835cf53310b2b55
#. default-sha256: 6749f6e2d5a889f2ce96e2694fa4e7238e7067c46250d77f93f9ea47b38ba44b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C6F8F9BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I did manage to break the ice, I hoped we would be able to do some talking—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"about the mansion, about him, about me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si j’arrivais à briser la glace, j’espérais pouvoir discuter avec lui de temps en temps—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫ du manoir, de lui, de moi."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE23C5F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8307f4b4b3cba7bba1e44c75ae5267f9801b21e8c09c5d0f3f05493dc3512e05
#. default-sha256: dda1828e4bf62294529b8f89417e309adc9c399e4804dde5a7e5ab4f972d7943
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE23C5F8F9BC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just had to keep working at it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je ne devais tout simplement pas relâcher mes efforts."

#: scenario5:scenario5_94B28477_ABF4_482D_9AC5_C312F87772BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cebab4a55c8e56ce835915c6367f544b55bdba166f5abdadfbf1a0e54a4b6153
#. default-sha256: 7938d47ade2bf1e39441cf8aa3a073f53416f08569e223a160402f916ceb48a5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_94B28477_ABF4_482D_9AC5_C312F87772BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Michel didn’t need me to take care of him.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He handled his own day-to-day needs "
"and activities by himself,⟪k:4⟫and in fact, he didn’t ask me for anything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Michel n’avait pas besoin que je m’occupe de lui.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Il gérait seul ses activités "
"et besoins quotidiens ;⟪k:4⟫en fait, il ne me demandait rien."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2CB58756_5E47_4229_A0F4_2057BBBB5DC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76b83941250a9956e8b7ac534956a2d81145ffac192ae6b51043bcb3d1002955
#. default-sha256: 59b45788f8ee1213a872bf3b7f681d3743c16a0370d23fc078ff99e59de4c7f5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2CB58756_5E47_4229_A0F4_2057BBBB5DC5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫An aristocrat who had no use for his servant—⟪k:1⟫I hadn’t met anyone like him before."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Un aristocrate qui n’avait pas besoin d’un serviteur—⟪k:1⟫ c’était bien la première fois que "
"je voyais cela."

#: scenario5:scenario5_08503938_3750_4B42_AD57_9D4057420069
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8f58c5ec96878e5073e837d0e46bd4f2cdba5f18106377603c2a687121cf320
#. default-sha256: b80e76d971f30e0a4b496b909f52be8baad248fbf6f1109156092f4817177840
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_08503938_3750_4B42_AD57_9D4057420069"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All right, then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Bon, très bien."

#: scenario5:scenario5_22229AC0_62EC_4C47_BBB6_981E435ED90D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03fae7358f8a18607bbc5027f254096be7c39fb1359f5c383e3ca2fd1a27f1ca
#. default-sha256: e3a9c38e965b1cd048150f62fd16a6b0890cdce9587ffd8ceadbcabfc0a4806f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_22229AC0_62EC_4C47_BBB6_981E435ED90D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That meant about all I could do was clean."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dans ce cas, il ne me restait plus que le nettoyage."

#: scenario5:scenario5_EBDE2311_051B_4F20_8957_58F329E531C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1688d253c417dc89c17d4ab086511cfa99d2aabb13b182bd7353563986d8ec7
#. default-sha256: ca502a28d8c5594c951874ac4709c77b994232c2c672487e978e6a462d4c87a0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EBDE2311_051B_4F20_8957_58F329E531C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure how his room looked,⟪k:1⟫but the rest of the house was, quite frankly,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je ne pouvais me prononcer sur l’état de sa chambre⟪k:1⟫mais pour le reste, la maison était "
"dans un état, il faut bien le dire,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_28A590F8_3E65_4CBA_9BB6_6B6A1F40E6F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3b355ee3653d9e06e513e2fd20481a0fc6dcc75873702faba30503762b2315b
#. default-sha256: 14aff6ec015ce25cdf5cb37a6a87a08dcfc08eec3e3391b58f82584e99f53126
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_28A590F8_3E65_4CBA_9BB6_6B6A1F40E6F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫an absolute disaster."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫absolument désastreux."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9ABE020C_6F10_4175_8CBE_9513F1C4460F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7efcb7b3f01d5b05b445b9a94e1a2d355dbd2a4e46f75bc0657aa636cf451ce
#. default-sha256: c2014d689547b8cb72524f5043ecfcc5876b1b7e7b6043eac43469beaa1a41c0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9ABE020C_6F10_4175_8CBE_9513F1C4460F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The dust was so heavy it was obvious it hadn’t been touched in years."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La poussière était si épaisse qu’à l’évidence personne ne s’en était occupé depuis des "
"années."

#: scenario5:scenario5_70932162_D4E5_48C0_AA9E_46305E93B326
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9e339591c243166116d4f6bf15f5e40db66b50fc62dd8ae37540d96452a01ea
#. default-sha256: b08236e0598225f5499a653e9f51eb25846e3d8f34b96e7cc2c8facb073c21e7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_70932162_D4E5_48C0_AA9E_46305E93B326"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Let’s get started!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’est parti !"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7F83E47E_F419_4757_9041_BA63BE0ED8E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6357d558759ad4f4ab3fa44c3b2222d078fb18593161fe3a81e0fd3d48451398
#. default-sha256: e0f18b2c7abfd3f4838bdcf0a928afab001c8043a95ef407e41d94f2abaf4a05
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7F83E47E_F419_4757_9041_BA63BE0ED8E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It couldn’t be healthy to live in these conditions, so I set out to clean each room in the "
"house one by one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce n’était pas sain de vivre dans de telles conditions, aussi me mis-je à nettoyer toutes "
"les pièces de la maison, une par une."

#: scenario5:scenario5_96BE2FEC_54AA_46B0_989A_AF2BB4AAAA82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ea184c8e7d99ec3e4d378c5fec98513ed0e9205cdfe1c198b5c0f26f81766f1
#. default-sha256: fddf611225347802343a8469b0eb40bb186cb5f587389599f5abbef6bde7f31e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_96BE2FEC_54AA_46B0_989A_AF2BB4AAAA82"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That said, it wasn’t going to be an easy task."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Cela dit, ça n’allait pas être une tâche facile."

#: scenario5:scenario5_903B6B3D_F1A4_4D9A_8915_EDFF16189AFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc73f817b053c362f763ba42642b9c32f74003ccf0ee66a20e8c1ffe807b8ad2
#. default-sha256: 177ca352c615fa674dde27d775b656b7d62de3b8b4f61ba89ca201b536a023ad
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_903B6B3D_F1A4_4D9A_8915_EDFF16189AFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not because I was bad at cleaning—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in fact, I considered myself quite good at it—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et pas parce que je ne savais pas bien nettoyer —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ en fait, je me targuais d’être "
"plutôt bonne dans ce domaine —"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6EED7906_7A20_4A87_9380_7D61E457C41A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a55b0e7ab96c011036e6a54751171e6aa2a185a6ec86a31ba51517f2ef0a49d
#. default-sha256: 5660b9eb2982e08e252cc2d7584f0bf1734d25da63b8128ad8a2c351772ef025
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6EED7906_7A20_4A87_9380_7D61E457C41A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but because it was near impossible to find all the dust and grime that needed cleaning under "
"the flickering light of a candle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫mais parce qu’il était quasi impossible de voir toute la saleté et la crasse accumulées à la "
"simple lueur d’une chandelle."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B410BE8E_78D9_44E6_BB98_E6A927B785DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 304fdb35bab1e43f0aa4ac39ad8223f9c03c7f90010ca0c44cb759ad14a1bfee
#. default-sha256: 8b93af95e6ae2a395b2e570f3b7b76c59b2ca4d40ffeaed873aa0868f0d99e59
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B410BE8E_78D9_44E6_BB98_E6A927B785DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I can’t understand how anyone sane can live in this dark.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What’s wrong with him?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je ne comprends pas, il faut être fou pour vivre dans une telle pénombre.⟪k:1⟫ Qu’est-ce qui "
"ne tourne pas rond chez lui ?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_356CFF91_0BC9_440F_B59D_17FAB597849E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fd593d4d2d0b165e0554cfada9d2fd8d5263fc0d484ec768a6770e47d614473
#. default-sha256: b7bdeb1f129d5bcbaea4f4068e38fc8eb600aebd817e48a8c0916dcb9c65aa2c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_356CFF91_0BC9_440F_B59D_17FAB597849E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Maybe... ⟪k:1⟫he’s actually a vampire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Si ça se trouve... ⟪k:1⟫c’est un vampire."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4CE48C0B_1CCE_4B76_9C3C_186F60FDDC5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e7dd869faab237acf7622deb9b5399fb869ef5139bdb2ef3fecd33961ba4851
#. default-sha256: dd18342b14a53e733470ab9e7f6c4b8e236f8a0e4c1318ba69d24437b6880da3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4CE48C0B_1CCE_4B76_9C3C_186F60FDDC5A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫........................"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫........................"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6490CE95_9D82_48C8_ABE5_66AB0FDCE1D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d296875f599c523e28df221745a2c334e21d8deac257d0ab62a166cf750623f
#. default-sha256: 1f0498e10cbd728ce81c4112d5ced12df04bbceeb40b48a7274133acf128c8b8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6490CE95_9D82_48C8_ABE5_66AB0FDCE1D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh god, hahaha, wouldn’t that be something.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can see it now... ⟪k:3⟫him sneaking "
